<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/17/eng@/~cl_3__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall apply to all statutory bodies and all companies and corporations established by the statutory bodies. Bill"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/17/eng@> .
